{
  "resume": "=== Khadim Ka - Resume.pdf ===\nKhadim Ka\n\nBronx, New York 10459\n\ud83d\udcde 929-503-7998 | \u2709\ufe0f kak392@oneonta.edu\n\nProfessional Summary\n\nReliable and detail-oriented Security Professional with hands-on experience in luxury retail environments\n\nand customer-facing roles. Strong background in loss prevention, access control, and customer service.\n\nTrilingual (English, French, Wolof) with an active NYS security license and a proven ability to maintain safety\n\nwhile delivering a positive customer experience.\n\nCertifications & Skills\n\n\u2022 \n\nActive NYS Security License (8\u2011Hour & 16\u2011Hour Certifications)\n\n\u2022 \n\nLoss Prevention & Store Security Procedures\n\n\u2022 \n\nAccess Control & Bag Checks\n\n\u2022 \n\u2022 \n\nCustomer Service & Conflict Awareness\nTrilingual: English, French, Wolof\n\n\u2022 \n\nBasic Computer Skills (Windows, Microsoft Word)\n\n\u2022 \n\nProfessional Communication & Reporting\n\nProfessional Experience\n\nDior \u2014 New York, NY\n\nLuxury Store Security | 05/2022 \u2013 04/2024\n\n\u2022 \n\nMaintained a visible security presence on the sales floor to deter theft and ensure customer and\n\nemployee safety.\n\n\u2022 \n\nMonitored customer traffic entering and exiting the store, identifying suspicious activity.\n\n\u2022 \n\nConducted employee bag checks at closing in compliance with store policy.\n\n\u2022 \n\nSecured stockroom areas and tracked product movement to reduce shrinkage.\n\n\u2022 \n\nGreeted customers professionally while supporting a high-end retail environment.\n\n1\n\n\fBaar Baar Indian Restaurant \u2014 New York, NY\n\nWaiter | 09/2021 \u2013 05/2022\n\n\u2022 \n\nDelivered high-quality customer service in a fast-paced dining environment.\n\n\u2022 \n\nDemonstrated strong menu knowledge to assist guests and personalize service.\n\n\u2022 \n\nMaintained table settings, cleared courses, and ensured guest satisfaction.\n\n\u2022 \n\nBuilt positive guest relationships to